{"speciesId":505,"names":{"fr":"Miradar","es":"Watchog","en":"Watchog","ja":"ミルホッグ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il attaque en crachant les graines des Baies qu’il accumule dans ses bajoues. S’il voit un ennemi, il dresse la queue."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When they see an enemy, their tails stand high, and they spit the seeds of berries stored in their cheek pouches."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il intimide l’ennemi en faisant briller les motifs de son pelage. Ses yeux peuvent voir même dans l’obscurité."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They make the patterns on their bodies shine in order to threaten predators. Keen eyesight lets them see in the dark."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Using luminescent matter, it makes its eyes and body glow and stuns attacking opponents."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Using luminescent matter, it makes its eyes and body glow and stuns attacking opponents."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il intimide l’ennemi en faisant briller son pelage et ses yeux grâce à une substance à l’intérieur de son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Los componentes luminiscentes de su interior hacen que sus ojos y su cuerpo brillen, y así intimida a sus rivales."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Using luminescent matter, it makes its eyes and body glow and stuns attacking opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"体内の 発光物質で 目玉や 体を 光らせ 襲ってきた 敵を ひるませる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il attaque en crachant les graines des Baies qu’il accumule dans ses bajoues. S’il voit un ennemi, il dresse la queue."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Ataca lanzando las semillas de las bayas que acumula en sus mofletes. Su cola se tensa al avistar a un enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When they see an enemy, their tails stand high, and they spit the seeds of berries stored in their cheek pouches."}